WEBVTT

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.760
It's somehow
a restless night.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.500
I don't like birds.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:27.840
Did something happen?

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:29.580
Not that I know of.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.520
Miyu has been
depressed a lot lately.

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.750
Ah... it's irritating
and boring.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.090
I wonder
what's happening.

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:08.850
Tokiya!

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.950
I'm home, Chisato.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:54.820
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:58.620
...and lead them to ruin.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:04.700
Long ago, they were
sealed in the Dark World.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:09.430
However, there
are stray Shinma...

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:12.640
...that live secretly
in the human world.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:16.440
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:23.210
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:28.620
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.060
No one knows her true face.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.150
I can't believe
you never told us...

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.290
...about your handsome
big brother, Chisato.

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.520
What do you mean?

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.660
You were traveling?

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:11.200
He has been in Hokkaido.
At... um...

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.400
At a bird sanctuary.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.590
Right... that's it.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:16.870
What? What is that?

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.910
It's a wilderness where hunting
is prohibited to protect wild birds.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.500
I got fed up with school.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:26.650
I went to watch birds
in their vast natural environment.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.650
I was talking with birds.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.790
Hmm... really?

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.200
You're going to stay home
from now on, right?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:42.630
If I can.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:45.100
What do you mean
if you can?

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.470
I have important business
to take care of.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.340
After that I'm not
going anywhere.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.510
What's with my face?

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.350
Nothing.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.940
Um... Miyu doesn't feel
comfortable being social.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.180
But she is nice.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.080
She seems to be.

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:05.850
But Yukari is...

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.250
Don't talk about me.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.390
Well, I was going to
introduce you to him.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.890
You weren't going to
say anything nice anyway.

00:06:15.670 --> 00:06:19.100
I longed to see you...
Guardian.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.450
Miyu!

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:37.890
I'm all right.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.520
Chisato, is there
anything to wipe it with?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.190
Let's see...
should be lying around here.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.090
By the way,
Miyu's clothes are wet.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:46.130
There are some towels
in the bathroom...

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.530
Let me show her where it is.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.670
Please.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:55.830
Tokiya is so kind to Miyu.

00:06:56.210 --> 00:06:57.610
She might steal him away.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.170
It's not gonna happen!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:01.670
Tokiya is my big brother!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:04.980
Absolutely not!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.680
Whoa! That was harsh.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.280
Hisae? Anything wrong?

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:14.350
Uh, no. Nothing.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.560
I didn't know that
the Guardian was such a cute girl.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.330
You're a stray Shinma,
as I suspected.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.800
I'm a bird.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.160
A bird...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.910
Are you... one of them?

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.540
I'll show you the birds.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.330
Impressive power!

00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:59.600
I don't want you to think
I'm still how I was back then.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.630
I'll keep that in mind.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:19.180
All right, see you
at school tomorrow.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:20.990
Hisae?

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.890
Ah, thanks a lot.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:24.830
Miyu.

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.330
Please come again.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.970
All right, then, bye-bye.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:32.830
See you tomorrow.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.270
Tokiya, what's wrong?

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.840
It's kind of awkward
to enter through the front door.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:46.150
It's your own home.

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:50.150
The entrance
facing northeast.

00:08:50.220 --> 00:08:51.780
It's a demon door.
Its direction is unlucky.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.320
There must be a flow
of energy under the hallway.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:56.920
He is taking
advantage of that flow.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.030
I can't tell Chisato.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.620
What are you
talking about?

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.290
You are being targeted.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:06.600
I know.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:09.140
Even if you try to avoid the battle,
if he is one of them...

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:13.700
...he would try
to defeat you no matter what.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:18.140
The one who will
suffer is you, Miyu.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.610
That guy is somehow
different from other Shinma.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.880
He might just
be possessed.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.290
Do you want
to believe that?

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:31.660
Maybe so.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.730
You are too
attached to humans.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.130
No.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.960
Because I am destined
to fight against them.

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:54.280
Tokiya, I've brought you
clean clothes to change into.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.030
Chisato!

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:06.900
Tokiya, that is...

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:14.360
This bird is a talisman
which protects me.

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.410
But... this is...

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:20.300
We'll keep this
just between us. Okay?

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.080
Good girl.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.520
Tokiya, I hope
the important business...

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:31.110
...you have to take care of is
not something dangerous. Is it?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.690
I have to do it.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.080
But I don't want to be
separated from you anymore.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.530
When you quit school
and left, I was so worried...

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:45.230
Chisato, I became
strong in the North.

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:48.600
I'm no longer
who I was before.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.140
Tokiya.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:25.030
You'll stay
home forever, right?

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:35.640
Tokiya had some problems
at school a long time ago.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:37.610
So our father decided...

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.320
...that he'd be better off somewhere
else and sent him to Hokkaido.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.860
But he seems
to be fine now.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.790
He seems to
have grown a lot.

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:48.200
I'm happy for you.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.400
Yes! I'm happy...

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:54.500
...because my Onii-chan (brother)
Has come home!

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:02.950
Chisato...

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:37.880
Why are you here?

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.320
I've come to see
my little sister's school.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.090
Is that all?

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.510
I wanted to
greet you, too.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.850
You already greeted me.

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:51.020
I don't want you
to think that that was it.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.730
I've come home
to put an end to you.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.500
Don't make Chisato cry!

00:12:56.940 --> 00:13:00.030
She won't cry,
because I will win.

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:01.660
It's not that!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.230
Then what is it?

00:13:03.610 --> 00:13:04.870
It is because
I am a Shinma?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.510
I don't want
you telling me that.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:09.310
You, vampire!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.350
If you insist on fighting,
I will accept the challenge.

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:20.420
But if you cause
Chisato any sadness...

00:13:20.530 --> 00:13:22.190
...I will never forgive you.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:26.120
Tonight... I'll be waiting.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.990
What am I going to do?

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.230
I need to let Yukari know.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.460
Do you want to be strong?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.170
What... what in the world...

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:40.300
Don't be surprised.

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:42.770
You and I belong
to the same group.

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:44.800
What are you talking about?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.570
Judging from how you are...

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.440
...you must have forgotten
how to use the power.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:50.840
I'll help you remember.

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:52.550
Power?

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.310
I don't have any power...

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.220
That's not true.
You have simply forgotten.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.460
You are not a bird
kicked out of the flock.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.490
It was the wrong group.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:05.630
It was a mistake for you
to be among humans.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.270
What do you mean?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.290
Wake up.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.090
Remember
what you truly are!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:40.420
Now you understand,
don't you?

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:44.670
Yes... I will
terminate the Guardian!

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:07.390
SAIKAWA CEMETERY

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.620
Just like you said, Hisae.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.560
I wonder if she lives
in the cemetery.

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:15.790
Let's follow her anyway.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.440
It doesn't seem
to be an illusion.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:45.290
Chisato. I will
challenge the Guardian.

00:16:45.800 --> 00:16:48.200
Of course I plan to win.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:53.230
But if I should be defeated...
I beg of you...

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:58.160
Tokiya, stay by me.

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.840
I will always be with you.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:03.710
This is me.

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.720
Miyu... doesn't
seem to be here.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.730
There is no other place.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:35.870
You are quick.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:39.470
You're not the only one who
can use a Kimon (demon door).

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:41.110
That seems
to be the case.

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.820
But the battle
has just begun!

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.200
What... what is it?

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:13.840
What about Chisato?

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.850
What did you do to Chisato?

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.150
She's sleeping.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.050
She doesn't know anything.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.980
Are you being controlled?

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:23.490
What's the point
of asking me that?

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.850
You're gonna die
right now, right here.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.430
Answer me!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:28.970
Behold!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.130
Here is my
true appearance!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.750
HIYOKU

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.920
That's your true self...

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.790
I'll never let
you get away.

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:56.820
That is my wish, too!

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:06.100
Why do you want
to defeat me so badly?

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.700
That's why I woke up.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.240
You have a human family.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.340
Have you
forgotten its happiness?

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.380
I didn't know anything.

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.240
I was just like
a scared, caged bird...

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.650
...poked at from
every direction.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:25.720
I didn't know
what I was living for...

00:19:25.920 --> 00:19:27.620
But now it's different.

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:31.120
I was reborn
with an ancient mission.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.950
I am a bird flying
across the heavens.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.120
I will defeat you.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.440
If you resent it, resent
also the origin of your birth.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.110
I don't resent you.

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:46.710
I just need to perform
my duty as a Guardian.

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:48.440
Fine with me!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:56.180
You're cheating,
aren't you?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.080
How dare you say that?

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:01.580
I see... you... Chisato...

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.390
All right?

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:18.700
Die!

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:22.780
What?

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:25.350
Stray Shinma...
into the darkness!

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.810
We couldn't
have saved him...

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.900
...because he
burnt away in my flame.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.810
Maybe he was completely
taken over by the Shinma.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.650
Chisato...
she'll definitely cry...

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.760
Tell her that
he left on a trip.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:08.920
He had been
traveling all along, right?

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:10.190
Yes.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:14.190
But I'm not in a position
to tell her that.

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:34.210
Tokiya?

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:51.040
Miyu?

00:21:51.140 --> 00:21:52.120
Is it you, Miyu?
